WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.960
Send the due reminders in one go, then agree a payment plan that splits old invoices into instalments.

2
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:15.490
Reminders go out by themselves before and after each due date, by email and WhatsApp.

3
00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:20.570
Here is every reminder sent, to whom and for which invoice.

4
00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:27.060
To send the ones due right now, choose Send due reminders now.

5
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:31.880
A tenant cannot pay everything at once? Agree a payment plan.

6
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:39.960
Choose New payment plan.

7
00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:45.280
Tick the invoices it covers.

8
00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:53.250
Split them into instalments, every month or quarter.

9
00:00:56.970 --> 00:01:00.340
Choose Agree the plan.

10
00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:09.060
Each instalment has its date. Attach a cheque to each one, and late fees stop while the plan is kept.
